WEBVTT

00:15:58.866 --> 00:16:00.986
Old people need less sleep.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.660
Not true.

00:16:02.684 --> 00:16:05.204
The sleep demands of the aged
do not go down.

00:16:05.584 --> 00:16:08.879
Essentially, sleep fragments
and becomes less robust,

00:16:08.903 --> 00:16:11.650
but sleep requirements do not go down.

00:16:11.674 --> 00:16:15.579
And the fourth myth
is early to bed, early to rise

00:16:15.603 --> 00:16:18.246
makes a man healthy, wealthy and wise.

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:21.026
Well, that's wrong
at so many different levels.

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:23.381
(Laughter)

00:16:23.405 --> 00:16:27.920
There is no evidence that getting up early
and going to bed early

00:16:27.944 --> 00:16:29.364
gives you more wealth at all.

00:16:29.388 --> 00:16:31.996
There's no difference
in socioeconomic status.